Description: Add image layers to 'ggplot2' plots. Images can be placed at
    data coordinates, used as plot backgrounds, or embedded as subplots.
    Supports local image files, image URLs, and image sources including
    'PhyloPic', 'Pokemon', emoji, and icons. Interactive image layers are
    available for 'HTML' output.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0),
    ggplot2
